{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>May YHWH turn His face toward you.</b> The opposite of 'I will hide My eyes from you.' The meaning is as I explained: wherever you turn, His face will be turned toward you." "<b>And grant you peace.</b> Like the sense of 'no harm shall touch you' — neither from a stone, nor from a harmful beast, nor from an enemy."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:39.666714779Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}